  "description": {
    "raw": "You seal the life force within the target, preventing it from sharing its vitality with others. Affected creatures can’t transfer damage to or from another, such as through shield other, a spiritualist’s life bond, or a summoner’s life link. Effects such as vampiric touch that steal vitality from others deal damage normally, but provide no benefits.",
    "search_text": "\"you seal the life force within the target, preventing it from sharing its vitality with others. affected creatures can’t transfer damage to or from another, such as through shield other, a spiritualist’s life bond, or a summoner’s life link. effects such as vampiric touch that steal vitality from others deal damage normally, but provide no benefits.\"",
